{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_strike\"><strong>Classic</strong></span><strong>\u00a0Movement Cooking</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Sling foods, parkour around the map, and coordinate with friends to serve every customer on time.\u00a0Play through evolving levels, tools, and new recipes  in a time-trial game mode.  Every level caters to your team size and only your best score matters!\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2145460/extras/LevelsGif-ezgif.com-crop.gif?t=1748717567\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Up to 4 Player Co-op. Different level variations based on group size</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">16 Levels to challenge your teamwork or your wits</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In-game voice and text chat</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Over 20 unique recipes with variants to create</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Tons of hats and accessories to unlock!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Over 40+ Achievements</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2145460/extras/Food_Shot_Image.png?t=1748717567\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">-------- <strong>Special Modes</strong>\u00a0--------</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Endless Mode:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Choose 1 of the 3 areas in the game for a endless run. Upgrade your run with placeable equipment or perks for the team. Put in that overtime, chef, because we got a lot of customers coming!\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2145460/extras/EndlessGif-ezgif.com-crop.gif?t=1748717567\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Food Fight:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Maybe take a break from the cooking and arguing with your friends. It's time to settle who's the head chef in the kitchen.<img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2145460/extras/FoodFightClip-ezgif.com-crop.gif?t=1748717567\" /> </p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2145460?t=1748717567","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2145460?t=1748717567","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2145460/c94fe53bf724bef38eab795272d579ea84b9ca3e/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1748717567","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2145460/c94fe53bf724bef38eab795272d579ea84b9ca3e/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1748717567","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Online Co-op","id":38},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_strike\"><strong>Classic</strong></span><strong>\u00a0Movement Cooking</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Sling foods, parkour around the map, and coordinate with friends to serve every customer on time.\u00a0Play through evolving levels, tools, and new recipes  in a time-trial game mode.  Every level caters to your team size and only your best score matters!\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2145460/extras/LevelsGif-ezgif.com-crop.gif?t=1748717567\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Up to 4 Player Co-op. Different level variations based on group size</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">16 Levels to challenge your teamwork or your wits</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In-game voice and text chat</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Over 20 unique recipes with variants to create</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Tons of hats and accessories to unlock!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Over 40+ Achievements</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2145460/extras/Food_Shot_Image.png?t=1748717567\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">-------- <strong>Special Modes</strong>\u00a0--------</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Endless Mode:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Choose 1 of the 3 areas in the game for a endless run. Upgrade your run with placeable equipment or perks for the team. Put in that overtime, chef, because we got a lot of customers coming!\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2145460/extras/EndlessGif-ezgif.com-crop.gif?t=1748717567\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Food Fight:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Maybe take a break from the cooking and arguing with your friends. It's time to settle who's the head chef in the kitchen.<img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2145460/extras/FoodFightClip-ezgif.com-crop.gif?t=1748717567\" /> </p>","developers":["Ardent Games"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Early Access","id":"70"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2145460/67f220d2832714442e303329da46a21a70e01919/header.jpg?